{"title": "Looper Insight-9", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Sensor head from Looper Robotics with two global-shutter mono cameras, one rolling-shutter colour camera and a 400 Hz IMU. The 10 recordings show how repeatable the solve is.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Global + rolling shutter</span><span class=chip>3 cameras</span><span class=chip>400 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>CC BY-NC 4.0</span></div>", "glance": "<div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_looper_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_looper_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>Recovered by MVIS from recording 1. The clip predates the values below.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.24<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>99.2<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+1.22<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>44.4<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option><option value=\"2\">cam2</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sensor head</td><td>Looper Robotics SA16 Insight-9</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Global-shutter cameras</td><td>2 × 544×640 mono at 20 Hz, hardware-synced stereo</td><td><span class=chip>Catalog</span></td></tr><tr><td>Rolling-shutter camera</td><td>1 × 1088×1920 colour at about 4.3 Hz</td><td><span class=chip>Catalog</span></td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Wide field of view; pinhole-equidistant fit</td><td><span class=chip>Catalog</span></td></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>1 × 400 Hz, with stamps quantized to 2.5 ms</td><td><span class=chip>Catalog</span></td></tr><tr><td>Sensor part numbers</td><td>Not recorded</td><td><span class=chip>Unknown</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "dataset": "<div class=two><div class=scroll><table><tbody><tr><td>Recordings</td><td>10 of about 66 s, 15.0 GB in all</td></tr><tr><td>Board</td><td>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 55 mm, spacing 0.3, t36h11</td></tr><tr><td>Licence</td><td>CC BY-NC 4.0, for the data and for this page&#x27;s clip and figures; commercial use by request</td></tr><tr><td>Hosted</td><td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/calibench-vi/datasets/tree/main/looper-insight9/\">Calibench, looper-insight9/</a> (access on request)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><svg class=board viewBox=\"-8.2 -8.2 429.0 462.0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AprilGrid layout to scale\"><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"/><rect x=\"71.50\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\"/><rect x=\"143.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"55\" heig